# Gradual on/off set to 10 seconds, captured from hardware 2026-07-27.
# Single variable changed from a clean baseline (all config features off).
#
# Exactly one key moved:
#   key 80: [0, 0] -> [1, 10]
#
# So key 80 is [enabled, duration_seconds], matching the [enabled, ...]
# convention key 77 established for the hourly chime.
#
# Key 5 did NOT move, falsifying the prediction that it held the gradual
# config. Its [0, 0, 1800, 1800] was assumed to be fade ramps because 1800 s
# is 30 minutes; that association was wrong. Key 5 remains unidentified.
# key80_before: [0, 0]
# key80_after: [1, 10]
# key5_unchanged: [0, 0, 1800, 1800]
